    <briefdescription>
<para>An <ref refid="structllvm_1_1xray_1_1_x_ray_record" kindref="compound">XRayRecord</ref> is the denormalized view of data associated in a trace. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>These records may not correspond to actual entries in the raw traces, but they are the logical representation of records in a higher-level event log. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
